# Ignore all font directories except those committed to the repo.
# Fonts like NotoSansCJK are downloaded on demand by build-sd-fonts.py.
*
!.gitignore
!NotoSerif/
!NotoSerif/**
!NotoSans/
!NotoSans/**
!NotoSansArabic/
!NotoSansArabic/**
!NotoSansHebrew/
!NotoSansHebrew/**
!OpenDyslexic/
!OpenDyslexic/**
!Ubuntu/
!Ubuntu/**
# Libre Franklin ships as a variable font upstream; these are the wght 400 and
# 700 instances cut by build-sd-fonts.py, committed as statics so
# convert-builtin-fonts.sh reproduces the UI headers without a network fetch.
!LibreFranklin/
!LibreFranklin/**
# Editor-group monospace faces (owner ruling 2026-08-06). Compiled INTO the
# firmware rather than shipped as .cpfont on the card: the editor asks for one
# size (12) in four styles, which is only ~83 KB of flash, and a built-in face
# cannot pollute the reading picker the way a /fonts install would.
!SpaceMono/
!SpaceMono/**
!IBMPlexMono/
!IBMPlexMono/**
